  "title": "SJR 624 (114th General Assembly): A RESOLUTION to propose an amendment to Article IV, Section 1, of the Constitution of Tennessee, to specify that only citizens of the United States may vote in state, county, or municipal elections.",
  "urls": [
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/bill/SJR0624/2025",
